{
  "_readme": [
    "High-contrast light theme. Kept COMPLETE: it declares every key dark.json",
    "declares, as the other shipped themes do.",
    "",
    "Every text colour reaches 7:1 against every background tier (hover and",
    "active included); disabled text reaches 4.5:1. Borders, the focus ring,",
    "canvas strokes and the 3D cut colours reach at least 3:1 against the",
    "surface they sit on, most of them 7:1.",
    "",
    "interaction.kofi is both heading text and a fill under black text, so it",
    "sits at the one luminance where both reach 4.5:1 on white."
  ],
  "meta": {"kind": "theme"},
  "id": "hc-light",
  "base": "light",
  "description": "High-contrast light theme: white surfaces, black text, dark accents.",
  "author": "Eltryus - Ricardo Marques",
  "license": "AGPL-3.0-or-later",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/RicardoJCMarques/EasyCAM5000",
